{
  "name": "New Order Intake (Core) – DEMO",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 – Start\nTwo triggers feed the same flow.\n- **On form submission**: open the form URL and submit an order\n- **Schedule Trigger**: click ▶ on it to create a random sample order\n\nOpen **Edit Fields** to see `{{ }}` expressions in action.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "af0ab909-7e7b-459a-a321-a6e08c67a579",
      "name": "Note – Start",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -384,
        -64
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 – Combine\nThe same order goes two ways:\none path adds a timestamp, the other adds store settings.\n**Merge (by position)** joins them back into one item.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "30ebb183-d182-4049-bc13-48e38ddd5ec7",
      "name": "Note – Combine",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        -64
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 – Decide\n**If** total > threshold:\n- true → rename the total field to highValueTotal\n- false → end at No Op\n\nRun it a few times – the random amount sends orders down different paths.\n\n<!-- by Naji El Kotob + AI -->",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "6cd4ce40-2e95-4ece-9a1d-407b408767bc",
